{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"107.77.233.221","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80828,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4f58320de13f725e450e581bb76ea9a0","RawContent":"We are getting married at Miramar beach florida on April 22, 2017. I started to fill out the application for an event permit and it asked for a time. We want to take pictures at sunset so the wedding has to be before. What time is sunset normally in april?","Attachments":[],"Id":1916584,"PostDate":1477463380,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                We are getting married at Miramar beach florida on April 22, 2017. I started to fill out the application for an event permit and it asked for a time. We want to take pictures at sunset so the wedding has to be before. What time is sunset normally in april?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ksjones88@gmail.com","IpAddress":"107.77.233.221","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1477462814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-287949.jpg?_r=1478705537","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Kaley","Id":287949,"Name":"Kaley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"47.151.16.34","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80828,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1477501060,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0a8b9b701a9bb90d802efa9ae48edd97","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi there!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can use this site to figure out sunrise and sunset times at the location of your choosing on the exact date&amp;nbsp; :) As a photographer, I often use this for my client shoots.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Not sure if they will have your exact city referenced, but you can plug in the closest major city and get an idea of when sunset will be. Hope that helps! ;)&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.timeanddate.com\/sun\/usa&#039;&gt;https:\/\/www.timeanddate.com\/sun\/usa&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916586,"PostDate":1477496983,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi there!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can use this site to figure out sunrise and sunset times at the location of your choosing on the exact date\u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> As a photographer, I often use this for my client shoots.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Not sure if they will have your exact city referenced, but you can plug in the closest major city and get an idea of when sunset will be. Hope that helps! <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a href='https:\/\/www.timeanddate.com\/sun\/usa' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>https:\/\/www.timeanddate.com\/sun\/usa<\/a><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-size:18px;\"><span style=\"font-family:georgia;\"><strong>MARIESAM SANCHEZ PHOTOGRAPHY<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br>\nWEBSITE: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><br>\nBLOG: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchezblog.com\">www.mariesamsanchez.com<\/a><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.mariesamsanchez.com\/blog'>\/blog<\/a><br>\nCONTACT ME: <a  class=\"bbc_email\" href=\"mailto:mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com?subject=BDW%20Inquiry\" title=\"E-mail Link\">mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com<\/a><br><br><img src=\"http:\/\/i287.photobucket.com\/albums\/ll150\/msam007562\/063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\" alt=\"063cb5c8-dbda-4822-87fe-ba3c0ebcdb7f.jpg\">","Email":"mariesam.sanchez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"74.100.61.37","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1285925545,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232833.jpg?_r=1422091823","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","Id":232833,"Name":"MarieSamSanchezPhoto","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
