> Time: 1484457700 / Sun, 15 Jan 2017 05:21:40 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=80829&SessionId=49f9ccf0048dd7b3b2232defca96c422
> User JulieDan2018 (287678)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.203.215.33","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80829,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3728ee039016a1aac10c4744d2f0be8b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey friends!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;So I am at the very first stages. My fiance and I live in Manhattan, but want destination. I&#039;m a little overwhelmed with the choices &amp;amp; every time I think we found the perfect place we find an issue as to why it won&#039;t work. I know it&#039;s OUR day &amp;amp; we&#039;ve already gotten the opinions of everyone imaginable, but we do want to be some what accommodating to our guests. So here are some guidelines \/ dreams we are hoping to find:\n\n&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We are thinking Bahamas, mainly because it is a short flight from NYC. It&#039;s also the only island we have been to together in the Caribbean.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;What other options are close?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We don&#039;t want to blow the bank - $30K MAX.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We liked Sandals, either Bahamas or Jamaica, but they are adults only.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;As great as that sounds, there is a handful of close friends that would have to bring their kids.. and we&#039;re cool with that.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Loved the Cove Eleuthera, but it seems super secluded. We don&#039;t want our guests to have to go broke over us if they only have the hotel&#039;s restaurants to choose choose from.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I think we might want all inclusive, but not a spring break atmosphere..&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m probably talking myself into a corner, but I know it can be done. Right?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Any advice helps!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916589,"PostDate":1477511883,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey friends!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>So I am at the very first stages. My fiance and I live in Manhattan, but want destination. I'm a little overwhelmed with the choices & every time I think we found the perfect place we find an issue as to why it won't work. I know it's OUR day & we've already gotten the opinions of everyone imaginable, but we do want to be some what accommodating to our guests. So here are some guidelines \/ dreams we are hoping to find:<br>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We are thinking Bahamas, mainly because it is a short flight from NYC. It's also the only island we have been to together in the Caribbean.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>What other options are close?<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We don't want to blow the bank - $30K MAX.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We liked Sandals, either Bahamas or Jamaica, but they are adults only.<\/p>\n<p>As great as that sounds, there is a handful of close friends that would have to bring their kids.. and we're cool with that.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Loved the Cove Eleuthera, but it seems super secluded. We don't want our guests to have to go broke over us if they only have the hotel's restaurants to choose choose from.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I think we might want all inclusive, but not a spring break atmosphere..<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm probably talking myself into a corner, but I know it can be done. Right?\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Any advice helps!\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"melissakworo@gmail.com","IpAddress":"69.203.215.33","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1477509539,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Melissakworo","Id":287954,"Name":"Melissakworo","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.47.210.87","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80829,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9c2c53d7833c8a573d7fc68fc987a278","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to our forum community Melissakworo, and Congrats on your engagement and planning for a destination wedding!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;We&#039;re based in the romantic Riviera Maya, Mexico, which is a highly popular destination for so many MANY wedding couples :) You can see some very beautiful reasons why in these magical wedding moments that matter we&#039;ve captured here lately......enjoy!!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Taken from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/10\/04\/King-Queen-joined-and-the-Grand-Sunset-Princess&#039;&gt;Grand Sunset Princess Wedding Story Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_c8dec0e5f1624b87b1ed72d0e5e77bd5~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_c8dec0e5f1624b87b1ed72d0e5e77bd5~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_c8dec0e5f1624b87b1ed72d0e5e77bd5~\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....and this from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/08\/11\/Sun-Sand-Rain-Shine-this-Grand-Palladium-Wedding-day-has-it-all&#039;&gt;Grand Palladium Wedding Story Album: &lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_4e88ab7bcb9c476aa91aa0e9dfed018a~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_4e88ab7bcb9c476aa91aa0e9dfed018a~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_4e88ab7bcb9c476aa91aa0e9dfed018a~\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...and this is from our &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/07\/21\/Imagine-the-impossible-on-your-Wedding-Day-at-Iberostar-Tucan-Playa-del-Carmen&#039;&gt;Iberostar Tucan Playa del Carmen Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_26d034ed81ef46f98e717ae8e42ec8f9~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_26d034ed81ef46f98e717ae8e42ec8f9~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_26d034ed81ef46f98e717ae8e42ec8f9~\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Hope you find all the answers you&#039;re looking for! Wishing you happy research and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916595,"PostDate":1477593393,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to our forum community Melissakworo, and Congrats on your engagement and planning for a destination wedding!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We're based in the romantic Riviera Maya, Mexico, which is a highly popular destination for so many MANY wedding couples <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> You can see some very beautiful reasons why in these magical wedding moments that matter we've captured here lately......enjoy!!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Taken from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/10\/04\/King-Queen-joined-and-the-Grand-Sunset-Princess' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Grand Sunset Princess Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_c8dec0e5f1624b87b1ed72d0e5e77bd5~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_c8dec0e5f1624b87b1ed72d0e5e77bd5~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_c8dec0e5f1624b87b1ed72d0e5e77bd5~\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....and this from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/08\/11\/Sun-Sand-Rain-Shine-this-Grand-Palladium-Wedding-day-has-it-all' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Grand Palladium Wedding Story Album: <\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_4e88ab7bcb9c476aa91aa0e9dfed018a~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_4e88ab7bcb9c476aa91aa0e9dfed018a~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_4e88ab7bcb9c476aa91aa0e9dfed018a~\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...and this is from our <a href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com\/single-post\/2016\/07\/21\/Imagine-the-impossible-on-your-Wedding-Day-at-Iberostar-Tucan-Playa-del-Carmen' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Iberostar Tucan Playa del Carmen Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/static.wixstatic.com\/media\/e89d55_26d034ed81ef46f98e717ae8e42ec8f9~mv2.jpg\/v1\/fill\/w_1200,h_800,al_c,q_90\/e89d55_26d034ed81ef46f98e717ae8e42ec8f9~mv2.jpg\" alt=\"e89d55_26d034ed81ef46f98e717ae8e42ec8f9~\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Hope you find all the answers you're looking for! Wishing you happy research and all the best with your plans - cheers!!! Moments That Matter Photography team <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i1378.photobucket.com\/albums\/ah106\/ContactIDoMexico\/MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\" alt=\"MTM%20Logo%202016_zps4tzm05my.png\"><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography , Cancun, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving the Riviera Maya<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Email: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><strong>Why we're Ranked #1<\/strong><\/span> ~ Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21512-moments-that-matter-photography\/'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><strong><span style=\"color:#0000cd;\"><span style=\"font-family:'comic sans ms', cursive;\">We Offer<\/span><\/span><\/strong>: <strong><em><u>100% Vendor Fee Discount<\/u><br>\n\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <u>100% Deposit Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong><\/p>\n<p><strong><em>\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 \u00a0 <u>100% Satisfaction Guarantee<\/u><\/em><\/strong>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280181860,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.136.107.243","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80829,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47e8be542144457c63cd655412519e71","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hey @[member=\"Melissakworo\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You have so many options, the Bahamas is so pretty, but Cancun and the Mayan Riviera are too. It\u00b4s a 3:50 minutes straight flight away from NYC. Have you think about it? And is so pretty.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There are a lot of Resorts with really good packages for different budgets, some of them have amenities and activities for your guest\u00b4s kids, they are really going to love them.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The good news are that you are at the right place, we are here to help you, just click at the Resort Reviews, believe me, there are options with really good prices.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Let me show you some of my Cancun, Riviera Maya pictures. Just take a look, you are going to love them.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;This is Now Jade...&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/now-jade-resort-wedding-38.jpg\" alt=\"now-jade-resort-wedding-38.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Look at this... Breath taking.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/IMG_6263.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6263.jpg\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;You can find more at my Web Page and my facebook fanpage.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916596,"PostDate":1477595375,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hey @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287954\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287954-melissakworo\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Melissakworo<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You have so many options, the Bahamas is so pretty, but Cancun and the Mayan Riviera are too. It\u00b4s a 3:50 minutes straight flight away from NYC. Have you think about it? And is so pretty.<\/p>\n<p>There are a lot of Resorts with really good packages for different budgets, some of them have amenities and activities for your guest\u00b4s kids, they are really going to love them.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The good news are that you are at the right place, we are here to help you, just click at the Resort Reviews, believe me, there are options with really good prices.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Let me show you some of my Cancun, Riviera Maya pictures. Just take a look, you are going to love them.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>This is Now Jade...<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2014\/06\/now-jade-resort-wedding-38.jpg\" alt=\"now-jade-resort-wedding-38.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Look at this... Breath taking.<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2016\/09\/IMG_6263.jpg\" alt=\"IMG_6263.jpg\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>You can find more at my Web Page and my facebook fanpage.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<img src='http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com\/BDW\/firma.jpg' alt='Posted Image' class='bbc_img' \/><br \/>\n<br \/>\nGonzalo Nunez - WEDDING PHOTOGRAPHER - <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.gonzalonunez.com'>www.gonzalonunez.com<\/a> - <a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.facebook.com\/GonzaloNunezWeddingPhotographer'>Facebook Fanpage<\/a><br \/>\nCancun, Playa del Carmen, Tulum, Riviera Maya, Mexico, rest of the world.","Email":"info@gonzalonunez.com","IpAddress":"187.179.168.180","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1282053079,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231467.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"gonzaloNunez","Id":231467,"Name":"gonzaloNunez","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"201.116.201.71","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":80829,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac4cb1b92d3e3ee7440d90ead2939753","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt;Dear @[member=\"Melissakworo\"]&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt;First of all &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ffb0b3;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;CONGRATULATIONS!!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12pt;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:12px;\"&gt;.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt;&amp;nbsp; Been engaged is one of the most exciting times in anyone\u2019s life! (won\u2019t you agree?)&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt;In regards to your concern, we invite you to check our venue, which is a&lt;strong&gt; &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ffa07a;\"&gt;secluded beach&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt; at the south of Puerto Vallarta. There are direct flights from NY to PVR and what makes out venue so unique is the opportunity to have &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ffa07a;\"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;a private wedding &lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt;with outstanding &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#ffa07a;\"&gt;natural scenery,&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt;at a magical place lit by candle light that invites everyone to enjoy the moment and celebrate love!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt;With our most private option, your guests will arrive on&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;their own boat, and witness your ceremony with the Pacific ocean as a background and our team of wedding coordinators will be in charge of making your vision come to life!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:14px;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#696969;\"&gt;We invite you to check our website for more information and here are some pictures from our previous weddings:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:83503]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:84559]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:84409]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;[sharedmedia=gallery:images:84025]&lt;\/div&gt;\n&lt;div&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:georgia, serif;\"&gt;For more information please visit us at:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&#039;&gt;http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1916840,"PostDate":1481123705,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\"><span  style=\"color:#696969\">Dear @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"287954\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/287954-melissakworo\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Melissakworo<\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\"><span  style=\"color:#696969\">First of all <\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span  style=\"color:#ffb0b3\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\">CONGRATULATIONS!!!<\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:#696969\"><span  style=\"font-size:12pt\"><span  style=\"font-size:12px\">.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\"><span  style=\"color:#696969\">\u00a0 Been engaged is one of the most exciting times in anyone\u2019s life! (won\u2019t you agree?)<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\"><span  style=\"color:#696969\">In regards to your concern, we invite you to check our venue, which is a<strong> <\/strong><\/span><strong><span  style=\"color:#ffa07a\">secluded beach<\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"color:#696969\"> at the south of Puerto Vallarta. There are direct flights from NY to PVR and what makes out venue so unique is the opportunity to have <\/span><span  style=\"color:#ffa07a\"><strong>a private wedding <\/strong><\/span><span  style=\"color:#696969\">with outstanding <\/span><strong><span  style=\"color:#ffa07a\">natural scenery,\u00a0<\/span><\/strong><span  style=\"color:#696969\">at a magical place lit by candle light that invites everyone to enjoy the moment and celebrate love!\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\"><span  style=\"color:#696969\">With our most private option, your guests will arrive on\u00a0<\/span><\/span><\/span><span  style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:georgia, serif\">their own boat, and witness your ceremony with the Pacific ocean as a background and our team of wedding coordinators will be in charge of making your vision come to life!<\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"font-size:14px\"><span  style=\"font-family:georgia, serif\"><span  style=\"color:#696969\">We invite you to check our website for more information and here are some pictures from our previous weddings:<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/83503-destination-wedding-las-caletas-puerto-vallarta\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18165\/sml_gallery_258213_18165_1418248.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Destination wedding, Las Caletas Puerto Vallarta'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Destination wedding, Las Caletas Puerto Vallarta' id='sml_image_view_83503' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/p>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/84559-a-private-beach-area-for-a-romatic-and-magical-ceremony\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18083\/sml_gallery_258213_18083_1094009.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='A private beach area for a romatic and magical ceremony'  width='200' height='134'  alt='A private beach area for a romatic and magical ceremony' id='sml_image_view_84559' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/84409-candle-light-at-las-caletas\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17896\/sml_gallery_258213_17896_215876.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Candle light at Las Caletas'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Candle light at Las Caletas' id='sml_image_view_84409' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><!-- bbcodeImage-js (do not remove or edit this tag) -->\n<a href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/gallery\/image\/84025-fun-dona-cake\/' class='bbc_url' title=''><img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_18217\/sml_gallery_258213_18217_2205384.jpg' class='galattach galimageview sharedmedia_screenshot' title='Fun Dona cake!!'  width='200' height='134'  alt='Fun Dona cake!!' id='sml_image_view_84025' \/><\/a>\n<br \/><\/div>\n<div><span  style=\"color:rgb(105,105,105);font-family:georgia, serif\">For more information please visit us at:\u00a0<\/span><a href='http:\/\/www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.adventure...gsvallarta.com\/<\/a><\/div>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343030003,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpg?_r=1475871220","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":4,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
