 their own ;)[\/quote]Woohoo!! Northern BC gal though. Not many have heard of where I&#039;m from :) \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1885794,"PostDate":1423509656,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Wafflesmom, on 09 February 2015 - 07:17 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Woohoo @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280150\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280150-cometgirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cometgirl<\/span><\/a> I knew I couldn't be the only one! Your wedding is in 3 months and a couple of weeks. How's the planning going?<br><br>\nAnd we'll count you as a BC bride Kim! Any province would be lucky to have you as one of the their own <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nWoohoo!! Northern BC gal though. Not many have heard of where I'm from <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/d