{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.67.77.101","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d6268369f59985755823a9daed8daed","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1885808\" timestamp=\"1423576021\"]\nNot sure I have ?!? But maybe LOL\nBorn in Terrace but did most my youth in Fort St John.\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]\nThat is quite North.  My fiance was born in Terrace, but grew up in Salmon Arm.  I was raised in Tsawwassen, now living almost downtown Vancouver. \n\n[quote name=\"Wafflesmom\" post=\"1885793\" timestamp=\"1423538279\"]\nWoohoo @[member=\"cometgirl\"] I knew I couldn&#039;t be the only one! Your wedding is in 3 months and a couple of weeks. How&#039;s the planning going?\n\nAnd we&#039;ll count you as a BC bride Kim! Any province would be lucky to have you as one of the their own ;)[\/quote]It is coming quickly and things are going well. Time FLIES by!  This website can be addicting. I had to take a break from it as I felt I was trying to do too much. Most of the resort stuff is done and ready (except welcome bags) and we are just planning the party at home now!\n\nWe got engaged a year ago and I told myself that we have to try and do things all the way along as I wanted to spread out costs. Well needless to say, time flies by, so never feel like you are planning too much in advance as things will always come up closer to the date.","Attachments":[],"Id":1886001,"PostDate":1423600436,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 10 February 2015 - 05:47 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Not sure I have ?!? But maybe LOL<br>\nBorn in Terrace but did most my youth in Fort St John.<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>That is quite North. \u00a0My fiance was born in Terrace, but grew up in Salmon Arm. \u00a0I was raised in Tsawwassen, now living almost downtown Vancouver.\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Wafflesmom, on 09 February 2015 - 07:17 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Woohoo @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280150\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280150-cometgirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cometgirl<\/span><\/a> I knew I couldn't be the only one! Your wedding is in 3 months and a couple of weeks. How's the planning going?<br><br>\nAnd we'll count you as a BC bride Kim! Any province would be lucky to have you as one of the their own <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>It is coming quickly and things are going well. Time FLIES by! \u00a0This website can be addicting. I had to take a break from it as I felt I was trying to do too much. Most of the resort stuff is done and ready (except welcome bags) and we are just planning the party at home now!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>We got engaged a year ago and I told myself that we have to try and do things all the way along as I wanted to spread out costs. Well needless to say, time flies by, so never feel like you are planning too much in advance as things will always come up closer to the date.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleyandjesse2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.67.77.101","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412102098,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280150.png?_r=1412131075","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cometgirl","Id":280150,"Name":"cometgirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b55955e595fc2c5c50a1c22bbb13c249","RawContent":"Ohhhh how old is he? Wouldn&#039;t that be funny if I knew him. I&#039;m sure I don&#039;t lol\n\n\nI&#039;ve lost my desire to workout and eat healthy - you know wedding planning excuses.  But fianc\u00e9 told me last night I used to be so active and moving around and now all I do is sit on that website.  Haha true but it hurt. Gotta get my crap together and get back to the gym. \n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\nEdit - I mean my husband haha\n\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1886026,"PostDate":1423634540,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ohhhh how old is he? Wouldn't that be funny if I knew him. I'm sure I don't lol<br><br>\nI've lost my desire to workout and eat healthy - you know wedding planning excuses.  But fianc\u00e9 told me last night I used to be so active and moving around and now all I do is sit on that website.  Haha true but it hurt. Gotta get my crap together and get back to the gym. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<br \/>Edit - I mean my husband haha<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399399802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.35.43.124","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cdd0d2fc674198db29494fa7b05b8ed9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"cometgirl\"] You still have a little over 3 months, you can do it. Yes, I agree that this site is addicting but I say it&#039;s research to save money. My fiance doesn&#039;t mind when I say it like that LOL We&#039;re spreading out costs too but you&#039;re right, time flies by too quickly!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"calgarybride2015\"] You deserve some time off! You worked your butt off prepping for the wedding so a little down time doesn&#039;t hurt. Plus, I&#039;m sure everyone agrees with me that we love having you here to share your knowledge :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886054,"PostDate":1423642569,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"280150\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/280150-cometgirl\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">cometgirl<\/span><\/a> You still have a little over 3 months, you can do it. Yes, I agree that this site is addicting but I say it's research to save money. My fiance doesn't mind when I say it like that LOL We're spreading out costs too but you're right, time flies by too quickly!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"277873\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/277873-calgarybride2015\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">calgarybride2015<\/span><\/a> You deserve some time off! You worked your butt off prepping for the wedding so a little down time doesn't hurt. Plus, I'm sure everyone agrees with me that we love having you here to share your knowledge <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410069785,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1454805895","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"50.67.77.101","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5d4a957416f1407faf57470db7f94fdd","RawContent":"[quote name=\"calgarybride2015\" post=\"1886026\" timestamp=\"1423663340\"]\nOhhhh how old is he? Wouldn&#039;t that be funny if I knew him. I&#039;m sure I don&#039;t lol\n\nI&#039;ve lost my desire to workout and eat healthy - you know wedding planning excuses. But fianc\u00e9 told me last night I used to be so active and moving around and now all I do is sit on that website. Haha true but it hurt. Gotta get my crap together and get back to the gym.\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\nEdit - I mean my husband haha\n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk[\/quote]He is 36 - name last name is Latham","Attachments":[],"Id":1886358,"PostDate":1423858828,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>calgarybride2015, on 11 February 2015 - 06:02 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Ohhhh how old is he? Wouldn't that be funny if I knew him. I'm sure I don't lol<br><br>\nI've lost my desire to workout and eat healthy - you know wedding planning excuses. But fianc\u00e9 told me last night I used to be so active and moving around and now all I do is sit on that website. Haha true but it hurt. Gotta get my crap together and get back to the gym.<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<br>\nEdit - I mean my husband haha<br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>He is 36 - name last name is Latham<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashleyandjesse2015@gmail.com","IpAddress":"50.67.77.101","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412102098,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280150.png?_r=1412131075","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":275,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"cometgirl","Id":280150,"Name":"cometgirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b3d44db2f83700cb41c1ed71e2f6794","RawContent":"[quote name=\"cometgirl\" post=\"1886358\" timestamp=\"1423887628\"]\nHe is 36 - name last name is Latham[\/quote]I&#039;m going to ask my family as we are all around that age. \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1886366,"PostDate":1423895346,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>cometgirl, on 13 February 2015 - 08:20 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>He is 36 - name last name is Latham<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI'm going to ask my family as we are all around that age. <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399399802,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.147.135.4","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b706aabe4af788ab053c821ef8d565e4","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Wafflesmom\" post=\"1885135\" timestamp=\"1423024482\"]\nI&#039;ve seen posts for Manitoba, Saskatchewan and Toronto brides but nothing for Vancouver or any other BC city. I just wanted to say hi to my fellow Local brides and see if we can share some tips on wedding gown shopping, travel agents, local deals and anything else wedding related.\nI&#039;ve met tons of lovely fellow Canadian brides, any local ones out there?[\/quote]Hi!\n\nI&#039;m not a BC bride persay, we live in Toronto now...but my fianc\u00e9 is from Burnaby\/Coquitlam\/Vancouver, BC and his entire family and friends are still there. In terms of wedding stressers, we are likely in the same boat. The hardest thing has been finding good rates for our BC guests (likely 30-40). The prices come in okay for Toronto but seem crazy for BC. \n\nWe are planning a 2016 wedding in Mexixo. Currently looking exclusively at Azul Fives. \n\nI can&#039;t help with a local TA or dress shops but I can shed some light on pricing we&#039;ve received. \n\nGood luck!","Attachments":[],"Id":1887032,"PostDate":1424473065,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Wafflesmom, on 03 February 2015 - 08:34 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>I've seen posts for Manitoba, Saskatchewan and Toronto brides but nothing for Vancouver or any other BC city. I just wanted to say hi to my fellow Local brides and see if we can share some tips on wedding gown shopping, travel agents, local deals and anything else wedding related.<br>\nI've met tons of lovely fellow Canadian brides, any local ones out there?<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nHi!<br><br>\nI'm not a BC bride persay, we live in Toronto now...but my fianc\u00e9 is from Burnaby\/Coquitlam\/Vancouver, BC and his entire family and friends are still there. In terms of wedding stressers, we are likely in the same boat. The hardest thing has been finding good rates for our BC guests (likely 30-40). The prices come in okay for Toronto but seem crazy for BC. <br><br>\nWe are planning a 2016 wedding in Mexixo. Currently looking exclusively at Azul Fives. <br><br>\nI can't help with a local TA or dress shops but I can shed some light on pricing we've received. <br><br>\nGood luck!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashley.taylor@live.ca","IpAddress":"184.147.135.4","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1423076261,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282006.jpg?_r=1468890791","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ashhtayy","Id":282006,"Name":"ashhtayy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1e5e27db0a4e633cd11beec822948af4","RawContent":"Thanks for the message @[member=\"ashhtayy\"], congrats on your engagement! We locked in on a package with Air Transat and I&#039;m glad I did! The prices have gone up, if I thought they were expensive before, they&#039;ve gone up even more!\n\n\nHow&#039;s the wedding planning coming along? I&#039;m also a 2016 bride","Attachments":[],"Id":1887104,"PostDate":1424551290,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thanks for the message @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282006\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/282006-ashhtayy\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">ashhtayy<\/span><\/a>, congrats on your engagement! We locked in on a package with Air Transat and I'm glad I did! The prices have gone up, if I thought they were expensive before, they've gone up even more!<br><br>\nHow's the wedding planning coming along? I'm also a 2016 bride \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410069785,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1454805895","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.75.217.249","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba752b157cf9fa346da948bb187cb5c9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;&lt;span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(37,37,37);background-color:rgb(249,249,249);\"&gt;Hey all, I am also a Canadian girl getting married on May 24 in Ontario at Bayview Wildwood Resort. Busy schedule and I don&#039;t know where to start all the plans. Ladies, I need your suggestions. We have planned a &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(37,37,37);background-color:rgb(249,249,249);\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.killarneylodge.com\/algonquin-park\/&#039;&gt;three days of trip to Algonquin park&lt;\/a&gt; &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(37,37,37);background-color:rgb(249,249,249);\"&gt;apart from other trips. What you all think ? I would like to hear from all of you. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1887700,"PostDate":1425007564,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span><span  style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(37,37,37);background-color:rgb(249,249,249)\">Hey all, I am also a Canadian girl getting married on May 24 in Ontario at Bayview Wildwood Resort. Busy schedule and I don't know where to start all the plans. Ladies, I need your suggestions. We have planned a <\/span><\/span><span  style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(37,37,37);background-color:rgb(249,249,249)\"><a href='http:\/\/www.killarneylodge.com\/algonquin-park\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>three days of trip to Algonquin park<\/a> <\/span><span  style=\"font-size:16px;font-family:Arial;color:rgb(37,37,37);background-color:rgb(249,249,249)\">apart from other trips. What you all think ? I would like to hear from all of you. \u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jaclynclaire@outlook.com","IpAddress":"184.75.217.199","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1425006545,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"jaclyncl741","Id":282270,"Name":"jaclyncl741","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.177.110.228","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9d1516feea9a8c4cee778d8472efa7be","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;BC Bride here too! (Born in Toronto though..shhh) Getting married in October in the Mayan Riviera - though still deciding on a resort.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891093,"PostDate":1427486032,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>BC Bride here too! (Born in Toronto though..shhh) Getting married in October in the Mayan Riviera - though still deciding on a resort.\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"stephlambert63@outlook.com","IpAddress":"192.64.7.143","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1420138649,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281545.jpg?_r=1427512744","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":144,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"CanuckGal","Id":281545,"Name":"CanuckGal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"96.48.159.21","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78730,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"98fdb84440228905ad0c804c35202abb","RawContent":"Hi @[member=\"CanuckGal\"] and congrats on your engagement! So glad to see another BC bride, where in BC? I&#039;m from Surrey (no jokes please lol). Please let me know if you need help with anything. This forum is so great and all the bride&#039;s here are so helpful!","Attachments":[],"Id":1891094,"PostDate":1427486802,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281545\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='https:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/281545-canuckgal\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">CanuckGal<\/span><\/a> and congrats on your engagement! So glad to see another BC bride, where in BC? I'm from Surrey (no jokes please lol). Please let me know if you need help with anything. This forum is so great and all the bride's here are so helpful!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"My planning thread: <a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/\">http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/79425-wafflesmom-moon-palace-planning-thread-january-23-2016\/<\/a><br><br>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;4;484\/st\/20160123\/e\/Our+Wedding\/dt\/-2\/k\/44c5\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a>","Email":"jerilee.valenzuela@shaw.ca","IpAddress":"24.114.26.77","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1410069785,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"https:\/\/bdw-stevewright.netdna-ssl.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279721.jpg?_r=1454805895","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Wafflesmom","Id":279721,"Name":"Wafflesmom","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":37,"TotalPages":4,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":30},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
